Which normal curve has the larger mean? The curves use the same axes.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.7cm,y=0.8cm]
\draw[->] (-6,0)--(6,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[thick] plot[domain=-5.5:1.5,samples=90] (\x,{2*exp(-(\x+2)^2/2)});
\draw[thick,dashed] plot[domain=-1.5:5.5,samples=90] (\x,{2*exp(-(\x-2)^2/2)});
\node at (-2,2.3) {$A$};
\node at (2,2.3) {$B$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

